        "serviceDescription": "CBIZ Security and Compliance is a trusted compliance and security partner who has years of experience helping organizations navigate complex compliance and reporting initiatives. CBIZ Security and Compliance in an accredited FedRAMP independent assessor (previously known as a 3PAO) where our dedicated team of advisors help organizations navigate the FedRAMP guidelines and complexities. CBIZ Security and Compliance can help from the initial preparation, perform gap analysis, and perform the final assessment for FedRAMP authorization or marketplace listing.",
