        "serviceDescription": "Sera Brynn, LLC is a FedRAMP Recognized Independent Assessment Service, accredited by A2LA to ISO/IEC 17020:2012 under certificate 4245.01 for the FedRAMP Security Assessment Framework. Founded in 2011, the firm has performed FedRAMP assessments since 2017.\n\nWe assess cloud service offerings against FedRAMP requirements across Classes A through D, covering both 20x and Rev5 packages. Engagements include initial certification assessments, Key Security Indicator validation, penetration testing, annual assessments, Rev5 to 20x transition assessments, and assessment summaries supporting Security Decision Records and Certification Package Overview submissions.\n\nSera Brynn is also an authorized CMMC Third-Party Assessment Organization (C3PAO) as of December 2025, and serves as a GovRAMP/StateRAMP 3PAO and FISMA 3PAO. The firm additionally works across NIST 800-171/DFARS 7012, NIST CSF 2.0, HIPAA, CJIS, and GLBA. Providers pursuing multiple federal and state authorizations can consolidate assessment work with a single accredited firm rather than managing separate assessors per framework.\n\nIndependence. Consistent with REC-IAS-SEP, Sera Brynn does not perform a FedRAMP independent assessment of a cloud service offering within two years of supplying advisory or consulting services for that offering. Assessment teams operate separately from the firm's advisory practice.",
